text:
marisol: quick flag from the console playtest — compact toolbar feels "tight" at 360px. primary button overlaps visual rhythm with the search field. screenshot: https://img.redwood.example/console/compact-toolbar-rhythm.png
eun: yep, that's our compact inline space. current token is `--space-compact: 6px`. for icon+label combos 10px is much better for perceived balance.
tucker: instead of widening `--space-compact` sitewide, can we add a scoped token like `--space-inline-toolbar: 10px` and use it only for adjacent toolbar controls? low blast radius.
reema: +1. also noticed a couple accessibility things: when the toolbar launches the run dialog, focus sometimes doesn't move into the dialog on Safari VoiceOver. and error toasts aren't reliably announced.
a11y-bot: accessibility smoke: modal focus transfer not stable on iOS Safari (heuristic). toasts with role=region may not be asserted by some screen readers.
marisol: proposed token patch:
```css
:root {
  --space-inline-toolbar: 10px; /* for inline CTA spacing in toolbar */
}
.toolbar .control + .control {
  margin-left: var(--space-inline-toolbar);
}
```
eun: looks good. please add a Storybook story at 360px showing the toolbar (icon+label buttons + search) so we have a snapshot test.
tucker: modal focus fix suggestion:
```js
function onDialogOpen(dialog) {
  dialog.setAttribute('role', 'dialog');
  dialog.setAttribute('aria-modal', 'true');
  const focusEl = dialog.querySelector('[data-autofocus]') || dialog.querySelector('button, a, input');
  setTimeout(() => focusEl && focusEl.focus(), 0);
}
```
reema: and toasts: use `role="alert" tabindex="0"` for errors, and `aria-live="polite"` for success. make retry buttons have clear aria-labels.
marisol: small copy inconsistency: toolbar says "Run" while dialog primary says "Execute run". let's pick one. i vote for "Run" (short and consistent).
eun: agree on "Run". i'll update tokens/copy.json.
tucker: plan: 1) add `--space-inline-toolbar: 10px` + Storybook 360px story + snapshot, 2) patch modal open focus transfer + aria-modal, 3) make error toasts role=alert + tabindex=0 + aria-labeled Retry, 4) unify copy to "Run" in copy tokens, 5) CI axe smoke on new stories. i'll open a single PR for tokens + stories and link follow-up runtime patches there.
reema: i'll do a quick NVDA/VoiceOver pass once PR is up. thanks! :sparkles:
